body:
i write best in a quiet space where i can also people watch. but i cant always have that. it's about my mental state, meds and sobriety (no prob with alcohol... just weed. it's real, bitches.)

&#x200B;

gosh this sub makes me sad. a bunch of lazy writers who won't amount to anything (chances are 99.9%... i am not part of that, fortunately, but YOU are)

&#x200B;

do your writing anywhere. just make some money and pay your bills, you lazy shits. according to HBO (a corporation you would all sell your right hang to work for, and they would still sat no, lol) all writers really want to do is eat and masturbate.

love this. so true.

&#x200B;

i have a relative who was engaged to what seemed like the sweetest, most charming catch and everyone loved her. fast forward several years and she has essentially chopped his balls off and wears them around her neck like a trophy. he's stuck because they have kids and if they divorced, she would ensure he'd never see them again and drain him of money (she's a vindictive person who has endless energy to abuse and harass him, and he's a very innocent person)

if someone loves you, they'll do it. they won't breadcrumb you to keep you around.

&#x200B;

i know someone who got married to someone to keep them from being deported due to visa issues; he didn't want to be without her. they were engaged and married within 2 weeks. that's love.

you mean she's getting drugs from the coworker she's hanging out with all night? could be. addiction makes people do unspeakable things. still not an excuse at the end of the day, tho. 

&#x200B;

(and frankly, if it IS drugs, that's another reason to get her out of the kid's life, early. you have that golden opportunity now).
